<title>SRI LANKA: Indian foreign minister to visit Sri Lanka.</title>
<headline>Indian foreign minister to visit Sri Lanka.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's External Affairs Minister Inder Kumar Gujral will visit Sri Lanka from January 19 to 22, the Foreign Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Gujral would co-chair the third session of the Indo-Lanka Joint Commission, set up in 1991 to foster bilateral co-operation between the two neighbours, a ministry statement said.</p>
